{
  "list": "
🔐 keyrack list
   └─ no keys matched this filter
      ├─ filter: --org someorg
      ├─ of: <N> keys held on this host
      └─ fix: check the filter — \`--org @all\` for machine-wide keys, \`--org @this\` for this repo, or drop it to see every key
",
  "status": "
🔐 keyrack status
   ├─ owner: (default)
   ├─ recipients:
   │  └─ test-key (age)
   └─ daemon: active ✨
      └─ (no keys in --org someorg, try --org testorg or --org @all)

",
}
`;

